text":"‘Nyampuju karna lanilani-jarri wuurnpa-puru.’","poem":2},{"text":"YAAWIYI, wangka karnangku,","poem":1},{"text":"‘Nyampuju karna lanilani-jarri munga-puru.’","poem":2},{"text":"Kuja-puruju ngalijarraju wungu karli yani.","poem":1},{"text":"Nyuntuku karnangku marlaja-nyina lani-wangulku.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nyuntu kanpaju palkangku warrawarra-kanyi.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Jukati-kirlirli kanpaju ngajuluku ngarlkin-mani nyiyarlangu-kujaku.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Yapa kajulu panu-nyayirni kulu-jarrimi.","poem":1},{"text":"Ngajuluju ngulangkuju kajulu maju-watirli putaputa-pakarni.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nyuntulurlu kanpa-jana warla-pajirni ngaju-kujaku murrumurru-maninja-kujakuju yungu-julu wiri-pajirnilki.","poem":2},{"text":"Panu-jarlu kanpaju yinyi kurapakaju,","poem":1},{"text":"nyanyi kajulu ngarninja-kurra.","poem":2},{"text":"Nyuntu kanpaju jaraju yaarl-winjirni jurru-kurraju,","poem":1},{"text":"ngula-kurlurluju kanpaju wiri-pajirni.","poem":2},{"text":"Nyuntu kanpaju warrarda winjirni pamaju kartaku-kurra yungunpaju wiri-pajirni.","poem":1},{"text":"Ngula-jangkaju pirrjirdilki karna nyinami pirda-kurluju.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"YAAWIYI, ngajuju karnangku wala-nyinami.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nyuntu kanpaju tarnnga-juku nyina yimiri ngajulu-kuju.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ngajulukuju ngurrju-juku kapunpaju warrarda nyina.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tarnnga-juku kapurna nyina yuwarlirlaju nyuntu-nyangurla.","poem":1},"Ngula-juku karnangku pulka-pinyi nyuntulukuju."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/wbp_wbt/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/wbp_wbt/JON/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/wbp_wbt/PSA/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}